       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MEDIA-PROTOCOL-QUALIFICATION-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MEDIA-PROTOCOL-BOUNDS.
           05  WS-RULE8-SOURCE-UNDER-68K   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE13-DAT-BIN-ONLY      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE17-NO-MERMAID-TEXT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE19-NO-RDF-TRIPLES    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE20-PURE-RFC1951-ONLY PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MEDIA-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-MEDIA-QUALIFICATION-MET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-MEDIA-CODE         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-SOURCE-AND-MEDIA.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-PARSERS-AND-SCHEMAS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-MEDIA-QUAL.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-SOURCE-AND-MEDIA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE8-SOURCE-UNDER-68K.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE13-DAT-BIN-ONLY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE17-NO-MERMAID-TEXT.
       2000-AUDIT-PARSERS-AND-SCHEMAS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE19-NO-RDF-TRIPLES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE20-PURE-RFC1951-ONLY.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-MEDIA-QUAL.
           IF WS-RULE8-SOURCE-UNDER-68K = 1 AND
              WS-RULE13-DAT-BIN-ONLY = 1 AND
              WS-RULE17-NO-MERMAID-TEXT = 1 AND
              WS-RULE19-NO-RDF-TRIPLES = 1 AND
              WS-RULE20-PURE-RFC1951-ONLY = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MEDIA-QUALIFICATION-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-MEDIA-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-MEDIA-QUALIFICATION-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-MEDIA-CODE.
